# Copy to .env and adjust. Never commit .env.
#
# This file must contain placeholder values only. Real credentials, tokens, and
# any PHI are prohibited in the repository (aidlc-e2e-rules.md §18, §19).

# Base URL of the application under test.
# The /clinical-ui/ path redirects to the site root, so the root is used.
BASE_URL=https://clinical.dev.rethinkbhtech.com/

# No credentials are required.
#
# The dev environment authenticates through the /temp-dev-login route, which
# signs in without a username or password and redirects to /clients. This was
# verified on 2026-08-24 and is recorded in
# aidlc-docs/automation/REQ-CLIENT-001/framework-reuse-plan.md.
#
# The route name suggests it is temporary. If it is withdrawn and a real
# authentication mechanism replaces it, credentials belong here as environment
# variables and nowhere else, and src/fixtures/auth.fixture.ts is the only file
# that should need to change.
#
# TEST_USER_EMAIL=
# TEST_USER_PASSWORD=
